<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Self Check - Frequency Adverbs Exercise</title>
<script type="text/javascript" id="MathJax-script" async
  src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js">
</script>
<style>
  body {
    background-color: #f0ece2;
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 20px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page {
    background-color: #f5f1e8;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 15px 25px 40px 25px;
    position: relative;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .self-check-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: -10px;
    left: 10px;
    background-color: #29b6d8;
    color: white;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-style: italic;
    padding: 4px 18px;
    border-radius: 15px;
    font-size: 15px;
    box-shadow: 1px 2px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
  }
  .item {
    display: flex;
    margin-top: 18px;
  }
  .item-number {
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 17px;
    margin-right: 10px;
    min-width: 18px;
  }
  .item-text {
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  table {
    border-collapse: collapse;
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 15px;
    background-color: #fdfcf8;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  table, th, td {
    border: 1px solid #999;
  }
  th, td {
    padding: 8px 6px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  th {
    font-weight: normal;
  }
  .row-label {
    font-weight: normal;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }
  .conversation-box {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
    margin-top: 12px;
    padding: 15px 20px;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 2.1;
  }
  .conv-line {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .handwritten {
    font-family: 'Comic Sans MS', cursive, sans-serif;
    font-size: 20px;
    color: #2a2a2a;
    padding: 0 4px;
  }
  .blank-line {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #333;
    display: inline-block;
    min-width: 90px;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 3px;
  }
  .page-number {
    background-color: #29b6d8;
    color: white;
    display: inline-block;
    width: 26px;
    height: 20px;
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 20px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div class="self-check-badge">Self Check</div>

  <div class="item">
    <span class="item-number">1</span>
    <span class="item-text">Complete the chart with activities you do and don't do. What about your mother/father?</span>
  </div>

  <table>
    <tr>
      <th style="width:8%;"></th>
      <th>always</th>
      <th>usually</th>
      <th>often</th>
      <th>sometimes</th>
      <th>hardly ever</th>
      <th>never</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="row-label">I</td>
      <td>&nbsp;</td>
      <td>&nbsp;</td>
      <td>&nbsp;</td>
      <td>&nbsp;</td>
      <td>&nbsp;</td>
      <td>&nbsp;</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="row-label">My mother<br>or father</td>
      <td>&nbsp;</td>
      <td>&nbsp;</td>
      <td>&nbsp;</td>
      <td>&nbsp;</td>
      <td>&nbsp;</td>
      <td>&nbsp;</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="item">
    <span class="item-number">2</span>
    <span class="item-text">Write five sentences using the information above.</span>
  </div>

  <div class="item">
    <span class="item-number">3</span>
    <span class="item-text">Fill in the blanks in the conversation.</span>
  </div>

  <div class="conversation-box">
    <div class="conv-line">A: What do Tom and Mike <span class="handwritten">usually</span> do on weekends?</div>
    <div class="conv-line">B: They sometimes go to the museum.</div>
    <div class="conv-line">A: <span class="handwritten">How often</span> do they go to the shopping center?</div>
    <div class="conv-line">B: <span class="handwritten">Hardly</span> ever. Maybe about twice a month.</div>
    <div class="conv-line">A: <span class="handwritten">How often</span> do they watch TV?</div>
    <div class="conv-line">B: Mike never watches TV, but Tom watches TV <span class="handwritten">every</span> day.</div>
    <div class="conv-line">A: Oh, I'm just like Tom. I <span class="handwritten">always</span> watch TV, too.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="page-number">16</div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
